  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is continuous at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><munder><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></munder><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mn>9</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></math> &hellip; <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\" separators=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>;</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is also differentiable at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mn>4</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></math><br /><math><mn>6</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math> &hellip; <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />From&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> &amp; <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>16</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
